flowchart TD
start["**Start** 
Initiate MOO optimization for three buffers to minimize WIP and maximize Throughput 
Buffer capacities for MOO: Buffer1, Buffer2, Buffer3 each in {1-10}."]
buffer_problem["**BufferCapacityProblem** 
Represents the MOO problem with 3 decision vars: buffer1_cap buffer2_cap buffer3_cap 
Each cap is in {1-10}. Objectives: WIP minimize; Throughput maximize (as -Throughput)."]
population_eval["**PopulationEvaluation** 
Distributes evaluation across CPU cores using multiprocessing 
Collects F matrix of [WIP, -Throughput]."]
eval_single["**evaluate_single_individual** 
Evaluates one candidate by running multiple replications and averaging WIP and Throughput."]
run_sim["**run_simulation** 
Executes the production system model for a given seed and capacities to obtain WIP and Throughput."]
nsga2_engine["**NSGA-II Engine** 
Configures sampling SBX crossover and PM mutation 
Runs NSGA-II over generations."]
opt_loop["**Optimization Loop** 
Generates new populations, applies selection, crossover, mutation, and replacement until termination."]
export_results["**Export History** 
Writes feasible solutions with buffer capacities and KPIs to CSV for review."]
end_node["**End** 
Optimization complete; Pareto front available for decision making."]

start --> buffer_problem
buffer_problem --> population_eval
population_eval --> eval_single
eval_single --> run_sim
run_sim --> eval_single
eval_single --> population_eval
population_eval --> nsga2_engine
nsga2_engine --> opt_loop
opt_loop --> export_results
export_results --> end_node